  #[#set par(justify: true);
  *CONFLICT OF INTEREST*
  ]
  
  #[#set par(justify: true);
  #h(1.27cm)Write down if your article has a conflict of interest with other parties. If there is no conflict of interest, write that the author does not have a conflict of interest.
  ]
  
  #[#set par(justify: true);
  *DECLARATION OF ARTIFICIAL INTELLIGENCE (AI)*
  ]
  
  #[#set par(justify: true);
  #h(1.27cm)Explain whether or not AI software was used during the writing of the manuscript. The following statements must be included in the manuscript:
  ]
  
  
  
  #[#set par(justify: true);
  If AI Tools Were Used:
  ]
  
  #[#set par(justify: true);
  "The author(s) acknowledge the use of [NAME OF AI TOOL/SERVICE, e.g., ChatGPT/Gemini/Copilot/Grammarly] for [SPECIFIC PURPOSE, e.g., language refinement, summarization, or data analysis] in preparing this manuscript. All AI-generated content was rigorously reviewed, edited, and validated to ensure accuracy and originality. Full responsibility for the manuscript’s final content rests with the author(s). To ensure transparency and support the review process, a comprehensive delineation of the tool’s application is provided in the 'Introduction' or 'Materials and Methods' section in compliance with the publisher’s ethical guidelines."
  ]
  
  
  
  #[#set par(justify: true);
  If No AI Tools Were Used:
  ]
  
  #[#set par(justify: true);
  "The author(s) affirm that no artificial intelligence (AI) tools, services, or technologies were employed in the creation, editing, or refinement of this manuscript. All content presented is the result of the independent intellectual efforts of the author(s), ensuring originality and integrity."
  ]
  
  
  
  #[#set par(justify: true);
  *FUNDING SOURCE*
  ]
  
  #[#set par(justify: true);
  #h(1.27cm)Write down if your article has a source of funding from an agency or from another party. If there is none, it can be written that the article does not have a funding source.
